24:16.566 --> 24:24.885
[SPEAKER_01]: and a G suit is too complicated for free flight pilots with respect to the modalities that you explained, Does it make sense to have some sort of

24:24.926 --> 24:33.677
[SPEAKER_01]: compression clothing to enhance your performance or in general be more comfortable in the cockpit of a paraglider? Yes, compression clothing

24:33.977 --> 24:42.185
