[SPEAKER_01]: you are at it. And everything else that you can have is just modality or an extra option to help you be in control of your aircraft a bit better. But

26:15.686 --> 26:23.220
[SPEAKER_01]: while we're talking about being in control of the aircraft and improving our handling, A topic comes to my mind that how do you maintain

