26:46.329 --> 26:56.455
[SPEAKER_01]: is one of the only things that doesn't betray. It is something in life that keeps on giving the more you put into it. But at a certain time, too

26:56.475 --> 27:06.768
[SPEAKER_01]: much of everything is bad. There's no rocket science to that statement. So do you have any thoughts on finding a balance between staying in

27:06.808 --> 27:12.529
