44:21.159 --> 44:26.502
[SPEAKER_01]: passionate form. But I think we have wrapped up this pretty comprehensively, unless you want to add a few more things before we move

44:26.522 --> 44:34.527
[SPEAKER_01]: on to the next one. The only thing I can say as an addition is that when you're completely a newcomer, starting a new avenue show, you're

