[SPEAKER_00]: different mindsets. Then you learn from that difference. Then you can choose this person. I need to be handled like this. So therefore, I think

45:15.217 --> 45:22.499
[SPEAKER_00]: this combination of instructor and me will do the best and come to that. That, of course, may take time. It won't happen overnight. It may take a

45:22.519 --> 45:29.421
[SPEAKER_00]: year and a half. But even that's not too long in a professional sport that you could have been for a long time. Testing the waters before you drink

45:29.461 --> 45:38.974
[SPEAKER_01]: them is the key here. It's as simple as that. Yeah. Hi, Sush. This is a little bit of a difficult topic. We all have our own challenges and

