[SPEAKER_01]: try and have a word with you about it, which is why I just stayed silent for a few months. But dealing with adversities and setbacks in aviation

46:09.290 --> 46:22.218
[SPEAKER_01]: specifically and in something that means so much, what's the blueprint and how to go about it? Okay, so one thing is like this. I'm a military

